---
InitialConnection: `0` || `40`
ClientReason: `Unknown` || `NoReason`
ProtocolConstant: `UNKNOWN` || `NO_REASON`

This error appears when the Bedrock client was unable to connect to your server due to a local network issue. Please see [Mojang's guide](https://help.minecraft.net/hc/en-us/articles/30688562181005) on how to resolve this issue.